// Tool definitions + executors for the schedule assistant.
//
// Definitions: strict:true where the schema is small (the API caps total
// optional params across strict tools at ~24 — the wide-optional upserts are
// non-strict), input_schema with additionalProperties:false and explicit
// required arrays (claude-api strict-tool reference). Executors
// take (sb, scheduleCtx, input), zod-validate write inputs, and reuse the
// EXISTING modules (replaceActivePattern, sequence auto-fill via mutations,
// autoGenerate/autoGenerateDayShifts, patternWarnings) — nothing structural
// is re-implemented here.
